#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "72_Onitake"
msgid "Damn, you're one strong mother..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "84_Kiryu"
msgid "Remember your promise. Leave the Kamurocho Guard alone."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_Onitake"
msgid "What, you think I don't know you, man? You're Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Onitake"
msgid "To think Kazuma Kiryu is back in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Kamurocho Aqua Devil Member"
msgid "Kiryu!? You mean, the Dragon of Dojima!? That Kiryu!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_Kamurocho Aqua Devil Member"
msgid "Holy shit! Kiryu's here! Kazuma Kiryu's back in town!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "144_Onitake"
msgid "Heh, Kiryu-san, buddy... Don't think just 'cause you beat me, you can let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Kiryu"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "168_Onitake"
msgid "I could care less about the Kamurocho Guard. From now on, the gangs are going to be fighting over who gets to take a shot at you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Onitake"
msgid "The guy that ran off is sure to let everyone know that Kamurocho's strongest, Kazuma Kiryu, is back in town. The gangs'll have a field day."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "192_Onitake"
msgid "But it ain't gonna stop at Kamurocho. They'll come from all over, hoping to get street cred by taking your ass down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "204_Onitake"
msgid "I heard that the most feared gang boss in all of Kanto is setting his sights on Kamurocho. I'd like to see who'd win that fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "276_Akaishi"
msgid "You certainly managed to clean up the Aqua Devils quickly! Very impressive, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "288_Akaishi"
msgid "With their leader removed, the gang should be much less of a threat now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "300_Akaishi"
msgid "Here's a little something to say thank you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "336_Akaishi"
msgid "There's always the chance that you may run into some of their remaining members."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "348_Akaishi"
msgid "If you do come across any of them, please bring us some proof that you've driven them out of town."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "360_Akaishi"
msgid "I'll be more than happy to offer you a reward. I'm normally standing in front of the theater, so you can come by any time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "372_Kiryu"
msgid "All right. I'll come to you if I take down their remaining members."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Akaishi"
msgid "I'll be waiting."
msgstr "Estaré esperando."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "396_Kiryu"
msgid "Things are getting out of hand. Word is the gangs are all out to get me now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "408_Kiryu"
msgid "I hope I'm not putting you in danger."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "420_Akaishi"
msgid "On the contrary, it was only a matter of time before gangs began to gather and fight in Kamurocho. Please don't blame yourself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "432_Akaishi"
msgid "Although we lack the strength to deal with them ourselves, we'll do whatever we can to help."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Kiryu"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Está bien."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "504_Onitake"
msgid "Hey, you finally made it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "516_Onitake"
msgid "I hear you gave some of my boys a real talking to. Maybe I can return the fa－"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "528_Onitake"
msgid "Whoa! You're... You're... him!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "540_Kiryu"
msgid "What's wrong? I thought you had some kind of business with me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "552_Onitake"
msgid "Um, well, uh... It's just..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "564_Kamurocho Aqua Devil Member"
msgid "What's wrong, Aniki? Let's take him out!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "576_Onitake"
msgid "I know! I don't need you to tell me that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "588_Onitake"
msgid "Listen, Kir... I mean, old man! We Kamurocho Aqua Devils don't back down from a fight till we win!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "600_Onitake"
msgid "You must wanna die, just strollin' up here so tough n' all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "612_Kiryu"
msgid "All right, come at me any time then. I've got orders, too. I'm going to teach you punks a lesson."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "624_Kiryu"
msgid "And after I beat you, you'd better stay away from the Kamurocho Guard. Got it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "636_Onitake"
msgid "Good luck with that! You don't know who you're startin' shit with!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "648_Onitake"
msgid "Your ass is mine!"
msgstr ""
